        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CLW01-Custom, 12 Inch Clearwater Hand Chiseled Acrylic Door Handle with 1 Inch Diameter</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis custom made Clearwater Pull is made from hand chiseled clear acrylic. It has a 12 Inch overall length with a 1 Inch square diameter grip. This acrylic door pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CLW01 Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Hand Chiseled Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Custom item. No Returns.</b>\r\n</p>",
